# Place the following DLLs here (see README below):
#   osqp.dll        — native Windows x64   (from osqp-dotnet NuGet)
#   qdldl.dll       — native Windows x64   (from osqp-dotnet NuGet)
#   OsqpDotnet.dll  — managed .NET binding (from osqp-dotnet NuGet)
#
# Download steps:
#   1. Download NuGet package: osqp-dotnet 0.6.x
#      https://www.nuget.org/packages/OsqpDotnet
#   2. Rename .nupkg → .zip, extract
#   3. Copy from runtimes/win-x64/native/:  osqp.dll, qdldl.dll
#   4. Copy from lib/netstandard2.0/:       OsqpDotnet.dll
#   5. In Unity Inspector for each native DLL (osqp.dll, qdldl.dll):
#      - Platform: Windows
#      - CPU: x86_64
#      - Editor: checked, x64
#   6. For OsqpDotnet.dll:
#      - Any Platform: checked
#      - Don't process: unchecked
#   7. Add scripting define: OSQP_AVAILABLE
#      (Player Settings → Other Settings → Scripting Define Symbols)
#   8. Enter Play mode → check Console for "[OsqpSmokeTest] PASS"